<title>USA: Bank of N.Y. is APT Satellite ADR sponsor.</title>
<headline>Bank of N.Y. is APT Satellite ADR sponsor.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>APT Satellite Holdings Ltd of Hong Kong has selected Bank of New York Co Inc as depository agent for its global initial public offering, the bank said.</p>
<p>APT raised over $183 million, of which about $142 million was raised through the issuance of 10 million American Depository Receipts (ADRs), the bank said.</p>
<p>APT provides satellite services throughout China and the Asia-Pacific region.</p>
